OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration as water leak
OL,4,Acontinues during drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a roadside water
OL,7,Fleak have been left frustrated it has
OL,8,Fnot been fixed for weeks during a
OL,9,Fdrought.
OL,11,FMartyn Smith, 63, said the leak on
OL,12,FManton Lane in Bedford began on 11
OL,13,FSeptember but "nothing has happened
OL,14,Fapart from a digger making a big hole".
OL,16,FHe added it was "very frustrating when
OL,17,Fwe are having to be careful with water
OL,18,Fwith the hosepipe ban and the lack of
OL,19,Frain".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
