OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration as water leak
OL,4,Acontinues during drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water said it was a complex
OL,7,Frepair on a main that supplied a large
OL,8,Fnumber of properties and added that it
OL,9,Fhad "needed to carefully plan the work
OL,10,Fand have specialist equipment
OL,11,Fmanufactured to complete it".
